00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:15,360
But suppose that you checked it out,

298
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:18,320
and it turned out to be true.

299
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:20,600
So first of all, would you get a little more confident

300
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:23,000
that alien abductions are happening?

301
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,680
Like you showed, about 10%.

302
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:25,480
That's quite a bit.

