321
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:12,920
like the Swedes get abducted by a very different kind of alien

322
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:15,080
than the Americans get abducted by.

323
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,660
And it's like, all right, well, maybe

324
00:12:16,660 --> 00:12:18,360
there's some kind of United Nations of aliens

